{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-3169","published":"2026-07-24T11:12:02Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:21:24.182048199Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-7017"],"summary":"perl-HTTP-Tiny security update","details":"This is a very simple HTTP/1.1 client, designed for doing simple requests  without the overhead of a large framework like LWP::UserAgent.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nHTTP::Tiny versions before 0.095 for Perl forward credential headers to cross-origin redirect targets.\n\nWhen the server returns a 3xx redirect, `_maybe_redirect` follows the `Location:` header and `_prepare_headers_and_cb` re-merges the caller&apos;s `headers` argument into the new request, without checking whether the redirect target shares an origin with the original URL. Caller-supplied `Authorization`, `Cookie` and `Proxy-Authorization` headers are therefore re-sent to whatever host the redirect names, across scheme, host or port boundaries, and including `https` to `http` downgrades that expose them in plaintext on the wire.\n\nThe HTTP::Tiny POD note that &quot;Authorization headers will not be included in a redirected request&quot; applied only to the URL-userinfo Basic-auth path, not to headers passed explicitly by the caller.(CVE-2026-7017)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"perl-HTTP-Tiny","ecosystem":"openEuler:22.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/perl-HTTP-Tiny&distro=openEuler-22.03-LTS-SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.080-4.oe2203sp4"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"noarch":["perl-HTTP-Tiny-0.080-4.oe2203sp4.noarch.rpm","perl-HTTP-Tiny-help-0.080-4.oe2203sp4.noarch.rpm"],"src":["perl-HTTP-Tiny-0.080-4.oe2203sp4.src.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-3169.json"}},{"package":{"name":"perl-HTTP-Tiny","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP1","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/perl-HTTP-Tiny&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP1"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.088-3.oe2403sp1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"noarch":["perl-HTTP-Tiny-0.088-3.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm","perl-HTTP-Tiny-help-0.088-3.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm"],"src":["perl-HTTP-Tiny-0.088-3.oe2403sp1.src.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-3169.json"}},{"package":{"name":"perl-HTTP-Tiny","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP3","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/perl-HTTP-Tiny&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.088-3.oe2403sp3"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"noarch":["perl-HTTP-Tiny-0.088-3.oe2403sp3.noarch.rpm","perl-HTTP-Tiny-help-0.088-3.oe2403sp3.noarch.rpm"],"src":["perl-HTTP-Tiny-0.088-3.oe2403sp3.src.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-3169.json"}},{"package":{"name":"perl-HTTP-Tiny","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/perl-HTTP-Tiny&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.088-3.oe2403sp4"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"noarch":["perl-HTTP-Tiny-0.088-3.oe2403sp4.noarch.rpm","perl-HTTP-Tiny-help-0.088-3.oe2403sp4.noarch.rpm"],"src":["perl-HTTP-Tiny-0.088-3.oe2403sp4.src.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-3169.json"}},{"package":{"name":"perl-HTTP-Tiny","ecosystem":"openEuler:20.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/perl-HTTP-Tiny&distro=openEuler-20.03-LTS-SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.076-6.oe2003sp4"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"noarch":["perl-HTTP-Tiny-0.076-6.oe2003sp4.noarch.rpm","perl-HTTP-Tiny-help-0.076-6.oe2003sp4.noarch.rpm"],"src":["perl-HTTP-Tiny-0.076-6.oe2003sp4.src.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-3169.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.openeuler.org/zh/security/security-bulletins/detail/?id=openEuler-SA-2026-3169"},{"type":